flowchart TD
    Env[.env.local / hosting environment] --> Config[src/config/site.ts · server only]
    Config --> Layout[Root layout · Server Component]
    Config --> Pages[Home / About / Contact · SSG]
    Content[src/content/marketing.ts] --> Pages
    Tokens[src/styles/theme.css] --> Styles[base / components / showcase / interactions / forms / pages CSS]
    Styles --> Layout
    Layout --> ContentContainers[Full-width layout + internally padded content containers]
    Layout --> Header[Header + Footer · server]
    Header --> Menu[Mobile menu · client]
    Header --> Newsletter[Newsletter form · client]
    Pages --> Reveal[Framer Motion wrapper · client]
    Config --> Tabs[Five image tabs + Framer Motion crossfades · client]
    Pages --> Tabs
    Images[Five original SVG preview images] --> Tabs
    Pages --> FAQ[Framer Motion height/opacity accordion · client]
    Pages --> Scene[Deferred interactive 3D sculpture · client]
    Pages --> Contact[Contact form · client]
    Contact --> ContactAPI[POST /api/contact · Node]
    Contact --> ClientZod[Inline Zod field validation]
    Newsletter --> NewsletterAPI[POST /api/newsletter · Node]
    ContactAPI --> Handler[origin + body cap + throttle + honeypot]
    NewsletterAPI --> Handler
    Handler --> Zod[Zod validation]
    Zod --> Mail[Nodemailer · server only]
